Fork side of the file that still collides when merging origin/main (90d6b98fd8) into the
v0.23.0 port. Base: merge-base 2bd378ed1b8d6bf2192cb26e0a55ff3091e6bd19 .. fork HEAD.

Apply after the merge with three-way fallback:

    git apply -3 patches/fork-side-of-merge-conflicts.patch

git apply -3 uses the index lines as the merge base, so upstream and fork changes to
the same hunk surface as conflict markers for a manual merge. The roster and bot-row
collisions are already resolved on this branch; package-lock.json is intentionally
absent (upstream deleted it when the repo moved to pnpm).

